{"id":"a1d58436755c6bc6","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-thm-kreisel-compactness.md","title":"Kreisel Compactness","display":"thm-kreisel-compactness — Kreisel Compactness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-kreisel-compactness","aliases":["58-thm-kreisel-compactness"],"display":"thm-kreisel-compactness — Kreisel Compactness","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","[[58-df-finite]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-kreisel-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-kreisel-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kreisel-compactness — Kreisel Compactness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,T,S,M,N,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,T,S,M,N,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Finite},\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S,\\mathrm{Assign},\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Finite},\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S,\\mathrm{Assign},\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> are the notions from the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> is the language-indexed model predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\Gamma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n&amp;\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall s\\;\n(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\Gamma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n&amp;\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall s\\;\n(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kreisel\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land|\\mathcal L|+|T|\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall S\\subseteq T\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(S)\n\\to\n\\exists M\\;\n[\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(M,\\mathcal L,S)]\n\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\exists N\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(N,\\mathcal L,T)\n\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(N)|\\leq\\kappa\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kreisel\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land|\\mathcal L|+|T|\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall S\\subseteq T\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(S)\n\\to\n\\exists M\\;\n[\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(M,\\mathcal L,S)]\n\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\exists N\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(N,\\mathcal L,T)\n\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(N)|\\leq\\kappa\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ordinary first-order compactness gives a model, and downward\nLöwenheim--Skolem bounds its size by the infinite cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The satisfaction recursion is explicitly tied to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>; the former binary model predicate could existentially choose a different language.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L,T,S,M,N,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Finite},\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S,\\mathrm{Assign},\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\Gamma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n&\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall s\\;\n(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kreisel\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land|\\mathcal L|+|T|\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&{}\\land\n\\forall S\\subseteq T\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(S)\n\\to\n\\exists M\\;\n[\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(M,\\mathcal L,S)]\n\\right)\\\\\n&{}\\to\n\\exists N\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ModelInLanguage}_S(N,\\mathcal L,T)\n\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(N)|\\leq\\kappa\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false}],"bytes":2112,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4260","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-thm-kreisel-compactness.md|58-thm-kreisel-compactness]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["90ce6acf0c65af45","d9a25b0ac94a3598","5fb1c2241d1943d1","65418b505fc53093","8b6a90316aad78a4","d9b8711cda3f31ca","64f35ba2e87964e0"]}